:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere"><input type="checkbox" data-rmt-advanced-exclude="typical_p"><span>Typical P<small style="display:block;overflow-wrap:anywhere">typical_p</small></span></label><label class="rmt-settings-check" style="min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere"><input type="checkbox" data-rmt-advanced-exclude="repetition_penalty"><span>重复惩罚<small style="display:block;overflow-wrap:anywhere">repetition_penalty</small></span></label></div>\n' +
